Regex features: alternation, ?, +, ^, $, classes, ranges, negation, \n,
and backward search exercising the reverse machine's anchors.

-- stdin --
,x/a|x/
,x/ab?c/
,x/[0-9]+/
,x/[^a-z0-9]/
,g/^h/p
,g/c$/p
,x/[\]]/
$?^a?p
?[0-9]?p
-- input --
abc
ac
a1b2c3
xenon
hello]
-- stdout --
aaaxabcac123]abc
ac
a1b2c3
xenon
hello]
abc
ac
a1b2c3
xenon
hello]
]a3^D
